ts tool. Returns its path. Reads only. Google Docs, Sheets and Slides download as .docx, .xlsx and .pptx.\"},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"const\":\"upload\"},\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A file under outputs/\",\"minLength\":1},\"folder\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A folder's file handle; without it, the whole drive, or its root for upload\",\"minLength\":1},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The new file's name; default the local file's name\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":255}},\"required\":[\"command\",\"path\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Upload a file from outputs/ as a new file. Returns its handle. Changes the person's data; can be undone.\"}]},\"strict\":false}],\"top_logprobs\":0,\"top_p\":0.98,\"truncation\":\"disabled\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":6789,\"input_tokens_details\":{\"cache_write_tokens\":250,\"cached_tokens\":6536},\"output_tokens\":94,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":0},\"total_tokens\":6883},\"user\":null,\"metadata\":{}},\"sequence_number\":97}\n\n"
